    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "PostgreSQL 19 的三处语法变化",
      "summary": "Shaun Thomas 梳理了 PG19 已进入的几项语法变化。ON CONFLICT DO SELECT 让 get-or-create 在冲突时返回既有行，支持 FOR UPDATE 行级锁与 WHERE 过滤。COPY 新增 FORMAT JSON，默认按行分隔，加 FORCE_ARRAY 可输出合法数组，但不支持 COPY FROM。另外 GROUP BY ALL 因与 ORDER BY 冲突已被回退。",
      "url": "https://www.pgedge.com/blog/looking-forward-to-postgres-19-syntax-potpourri",
      "author": "Shaun Thomas",
      "source": "pgEdge 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-08-07",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "PG19",
        "SQL",
        "语法"
      ],
      "position": 2
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "给 AI 智能体配行级安全的可测试做法",
      "summary": "Andrei Mironov 给出一份面向 AI 智能体的行级安全配置，强调要用智能体自己的连接验收。表属主与智能体角色分开，后者带 NOSUPERUSER 与 NOBYPASSRLS；表上同时 ENABLE 与 FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY，再按命令写 USING 和 WITH CHECK。文中点出四个坑：属主绕过策略、漏写 WITH CHECK 让行改到别的租户、租户上下文由客户端设定，以及 TRUNCATE 不受约束。",
      "url": "https://datamcp.app/blog/postgresql-row-level-security-ai-agents",
      "author": "Andrei Mironov",
      "source": "datamcp.app",
      "source_date": "2026-08-07",
      "image": "https://datamcp.app/blog/postgresql-row-level-security-ai-agents/opengraph-image?a53005e8cac9496b=",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "行级安全",
        "多租户",
        "AI"
      ],
      "position": 3
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "ignore_invalid_pages 是撬棍不是开关",
      "summary": "Christophe Pettus 的 GUC 逐项谈接着讲 ignore_invalid_pages：它把 WAL 重放时两处 PANIC 降级为警告，让引用了无效页面的实例仍能启动。该参数默认关闭，属于 postmaster 级别，改动需要重启，只在归档恢复、备库和时间点恢复时起作用。作者的警告很直接：不要为了止住崩溃一直开着，那样打开的库会在未知位置缺失未知数量的数据。合理用法只有在可丢弃的副本上打开它抢救可读数据。",
      "url": "https://thebuild.com/blog/all-your-gucs-in-a-row-ignore_invalid_pages/",
      "author": "Christophe Pettus",
      "source": "thebuild.com",
      "source_date": "2026-08-07",
      "image": "https://thebuild.com/media/media/595de48a8cbf434992d8f6d51b52bc51.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "参数",
        "恢复",
        "数据损坏"
      ],
